              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "كمان — kamān — \"a violin\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تتعلم أختي الكمان في المدرسة. tataʿallamu ukhtī al-kamān fī al-madrasa. My sister is learning the violin at school."
            }
          ]
        },
