          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "كمان (kamān) was borrowed into Arabic and is usually traced to Persian kamān, \"a bow\": the violin is the instrument played with a bow."
            }
          ]
        },
